    "summary": "Pair of man&#039;s shoes made of white goat skin. Backs of shoes are cut and folded inside so that the heel is exposed; uppers have rectangular tongue. Shoes lined with red-dyed goat skin, additional layers of yellow- and red-dyed skin nailed to shoe from heel to midway. Uppers richly embroidered with red, blue, green and orange silk thread in floral and geometric patterns. Shoes edged along inside with alternating red and yellow cotton thread. Single blue silk pompom on top edge of tongue.",
